evidence explicitly before expanding; do not crawl the repo to fill omissions.
Run overview -> packet -> exact evidence -> new-process read on frozen/disposable
sources, then Prime's read-only actual desk use after acceptance. Record manual
steps and gaps. Rendering clarity is not proof of a cold model's understanding.
M1-M3 accepted as required safeguards, not automatic defects in the not-yet-reviewed
0524 implementation. Optional view fingerprint may wait. No tool fix or new Claude
